# gpw-xdm-ice — offline oracle note

## CP2K status

CP2K 2026.1 `PAIR_POTENTIAL TYPE` accepts only
`DFTD2|DFTD3|DFTD3(BJ)|DFTD4`. There is **no** stock `TYPE XDM`.

Full (density-dependent) XDM oracles: postg, critic2, Quantum ESPRESSO
`xdm_dispersion`. This Atomiverse slug ships the **free-atom** foothold
(geometry-only multipole moments + CRC α) with a dual pure-Python pin.

## Geometry (Å)

Water dimer, cubic 12 Å cell, PERIODIC XYZ — same as `gpw-ts-ice`.

## Offline pin (dual pure-Python)

Free-atom XDM, QE NC-PBE a1=0.4283, a2=2.4690 Å, rcut 50 Å:

- Isolated: E_disp = -2.1020435998516220e-03 Ha
- Periodic: E_disp = -2.1148157612879029e-03 Ha

See `regressions/gpw/gpw-xdm-ice/REFERENCE.md`.
